      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng fights Feng Jiu Ge inside a soul battlefield. After Feng Jiu Ge critiques soul taker battlefield as an early Spectral Soul creation, Qin Bai Sheng changes the battlefield, and Feng Jiu Ge recognizes Hundred Million Slaughterfield, a battlefield killer move Spectral Soul Demon Venerable created in his later years.",
